    <question_explanation no="6" id="PRB-7F33884B32573252-Q6">
      <question_stem>임피던스 $Z = 10 + j5$ [Ω]에 대한 서셉턴스[S]는?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>임피던스 $Z = 10 + j5$ [Ω]</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>2</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>－0.04</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 전기이론 · 서셉턴스
정답은 ②이다. 어드미턴스는 Y = 1/Z = 1/(10 + j5) = (10 − j5)/(10² + 5²) = 0.08 − j0.04 S이다. Y = G + jB이므로 서셉턴스는 B = −0.04 S이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>－0.2</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>－0.04</choice_text>
          <commentary>−0.04 S이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>0.04</choice_text>
          <commentary>부호가 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>0.2</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
