    <question_explanation no="8" id="PRB-7F33884B32573252-Q8">
      <question_stem>$\triangle$결선 평형 3상 부하의 각 상임피던스가 $15 + j3$ [Ω]일 경우, 이와 등가인 Y결선의 상임피던스[Ω]는?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>결선</keyword>
        <keyword>평형</keyword>
        <keyword>부하</keyword>
        <keyword>상임피던스</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>1</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>$5 + j1$</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 전기이론 · Δ-Y 변환
정답은 ①이다. 평형 Δ결선 부하를 등가 Y결선으로 바꾸면 상임피던스는 ZY = ZΔ/3 = (15 + j3)/3 = 5 + j1 Ω이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>$5 + j1$</choice_text>
          <commentary>5 + j1 Ω이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$45 + j9$</choice_text>
          <commentary>3배로 계산한 값이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$\frac{15}{\sqrt{3}} + j \sqrt{3}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>√3으로 나눈 값이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$\sqrt{3} ( 15 + j3 )$</choice_text>
          <commentary>√3배한 값이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
